Description: add the missing #include <map> to monero_wallet_model.h
Category: build-only; needed with Boost newer than 1.76; no change to wallet behavior
Provenance: build-only patch of the zephyr-backports WebAssembly build, original file SHA-256
 a55718fc9d5b3901e0dde380114a4e156e2bfeed2af11973c73c6b0b8700db64 (the diff below is unchanged)
Drop-when: upstream adds the include, or Boost is pinned back to 1.76

monero_wallet_model.h uses std::map without including <map>; Boost 1.76 provided it
transitively, Boost 1.77 and later do not.

diff --git a/src/wallet/monero_wallet_model.h b/src/wallet/monero_wallet_model.h
index 6b88dfa..21d6f22 100644
--- a/src/wallet/monero_wallet_model.h
+++ b/src/wallet/monero_wallet_model.h
@@ -53,6 +53,7 @@
 #pragma once
 
 #include "daemon/monero_daemon_model.h"
+#include <map>
 
 using namespace monero;
 
